	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "atm-challenge-metafar-2026",
		"name": "ATM Challenge API - Metafar",
		"description": "Colección completa para probar la API del Challenge ATM.\n\n**Instrucciones:**\n1. Ejecuta primero \"1. Login Exitoso\" para obtener el token JWT\n2. El token se guarda automáticamente en la variable `jwt_token`\n3. Todos los demás endpoints usan automáticamente este token\n\n**Datos de prueba:**\n- Tarjeta: 4000000000000001 | PIN: 1234\n- Tarjeta: 4000000000000002 | PIN: 5678\n- Tarjeta: 4000000000000003 | PIN: 9999\n- Tarjeta: 4000000000000004 | PIN: 1111\n- Tarjeta: 4000000000000005 | PIN: 2222",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Autenticación",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1.1 Login Exitoso - Juan Pérez",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"jwt_token\", jsonData.token);",
									"    pm.test(\"Token guardado correctamente\", function () {",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData.token).to.be.a('string');",
									"    });",
									"} else {",
									"    pm.test(\"Login exitoso\", function () {",
									"        pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"cardNumber\": \"4000000000000001\",\n  \"pin\": \"1234\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"auth",
								"login"
							]
						},
						"description": "Login con credenciales válidas. El token se guarda automáticamente."
					},
					"response": []
				},
